OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Flargely clear night for most, once any
OL,7,Fdaytime cloud fades or isolated
OL,8,Fcoastal showers ease. However the odd
OL,9,Fshower is possible across Norfolk and
OL,10,FSuffolk. Turning rather cold beneath
OL,11,Fthe cloud-free skies.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA cold start, followed by a
OL,14,Fbright and often sunny day. The odd
OL,15,Fshower remains possible, especially
OL,16,Falong the north and east coasts. Cold
OL,17,Fand breezy overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
