OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FFine,
OL,6,Fbut cold Friday with sunny spells.
OL,7,FSome cloud building overnight, however
OL,8,Fsome patchy frost still likely. Likely
OL,9,Frather cloudy Saturday and Sunday, but
OL,10,Fperhaps turning less cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
